      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At the moment, the Looks menu is irrelevant to me in the action menu because I have not bought accessories, and no public SDK exists to create my own accessories. As an user, I would like an option to hide the Looks menu from Action Menu for my use scenario.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
